90" end="00:14.940">say </span><span begin="00:14.940" end="00:15.570">（</span><span begin="00:15.570" end="00:17.100">oh</span><span begin="00:17.100" end="00:17.790">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.790" end="00:20.700"><span begin="00:17.790" end="00:18.000">The </span><span begin="00:18.000" end="00:18.480">words </span><span begin="00:18.480" end="00:18.690">that </span><span begin="00:18.690" end="00:18.810">were </span><span begin="00:18.810" end="00:20.700">mend</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.120" end="00:24.240"><span begin="00:21.120" end="00:21.270">The </span><span begin="00:21.270" end="00:21.750">things </span><span begin="00:21.750" end="00:21.960">that </span><span begin="00:21.960" end="00:22.140">were </span><span begin="00:22.140" end="00:24.240">broken</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.520" end="00:32.670"><span begin="00:26.520" end="00:26.760">But </span><span begin="00:26.760" end="00:27.210">now </span><span begin="00:27.210" end="00:27.690">it's </span><span begin="00:27.690" end="00:28.110">far </span><span begin="00:28.110" end="00:28.650">too </span><span begin="00:28.650" end="00:29.430">late </span><span begin="00:29.430" end="00:29.760">she </span><span begin="00:29.760" end="00:29.850">'s </span><span begin="00:29.850" end="00:30.720">gone </span><span begin="00:30.720" end="00:32.670">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.590" end="00:39.030"><span begin="00:34.590" end="00:35.250">Every </span><span begin="00:35.250" end="00:36.150">night </span><span begin="00:36.150" end="00:36.540">you </span><span begin="00:36.540" end="00:37.260">cry </span><span begin="00:37.260" end="00:38.310">yourself </span><span begin="00:38.310" end="00:38.430">to </span><span begin="00:38.430" end="00:39.030">sleep</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.060" end="00:43.410"><span begin="00:39.060" end="00:39.600">Thinking </span><span begin="00:39.600" end="00:39.630">"</span><span begin="00:39.630" end="00:40.440">why </span><span begin="00:40.440" end="00:41.040">does </span><span begin="00:41.040" end="00:41.400">this </span><span begin="00:41.400" end="00:42.660">happen </span><span begin="00:42.660" end="00:42.810">to </span><span begin="00:42.810" end="00:43.380">me</span><span begin="00:43.380" end="00:43.410">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.410" end="00:50.400"><span begin="00:43.410" end="00:43.770">Why </span><span begin="00:43.770" end="00:44.100">does </span><span begin="00:44.100" end="00:45.330">every </span><span begin="00:45.330" end="00:46.410">moment </span><span begin="00:46.410" end="00:47.010">have </span><span begin="00:47.010" end="00:47.280">to </span><span begin="00:47.280" end="00:47.640">be </span><span begin="00:47.640" end="00:48.330">so </span><span begin="00:48.330" end="00:50.370">hard</span><span begin="00:50.370" end="00:50.370">?</span><span begin="00:50.370" end="00:50.400">"</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.030" end="00:52.950"><span begin="00:51.030" end="00:51.390">Hard </span><span begin="00:51.390" end="00:51.630">to </span><span begin="00:51.630" end="00:52.530">believe </span><span begin="00:52.530" end="00:52.950">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.040" end="00:55.950"><span begin="00:53.040" end="00:53.550">It's </span><span begin="00:53.550" end="00:54.180">not </span><span begin="00:54.180" end="00:54.600">over </span><span begin="00:54.600" end="00:55.950">tonight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.980" end="01:00.300"><span begin="00:55.980" end="00:56.340">Just </span><span begin="00:56.340" end="00:56.580">give </span><span begin="00:56.580" end="00:56.790">me </span><span begin="00:56.790" end="00:57.120">one </span><span begin="00:57.120" end="00:57.300">more </span><span begin="00:57.300" end="00:57.930">chance </span><span begin="00:57.930" end="00:58.170">to </span><span begin="00:58.170" end="00:58.710">make </span><span begin="00:58.710" end="00:58.980">it </span><span begin="00:58.980" 